  // already has correct proportions; applying non-uniform body.scale.x
  // / scale.y stretches the rigid OBJ slices off their bone pivots
  // (e.g. shoulders away from the chest, hands away from wrists). NPCs
  // got the correct look because randomBotPalette never set
  // `bodyBuild`, so their effective scale stayed 1×1. We force the
  // same 1×1 here for the player so the OBJ body proportions match
  // the slicer's pivot offsets.
  body.scale.x = 1;
  body.scale.y = 1;
